script = ExtResource("12_131en")
pages = PackedStringArray("*Day 12.* The crypt wards hold. The Batela peasants have not come near. The chapel\'s old bell rang by itself at midnight; Brother Callis wept.", "*Day 19.* The Archmagus has found the vault the old monks sealed. A spark of the Dreamer\'s own light, sleeping in a jar. It will not burn for us. It will not burn at all for us.", "*Day 26.* Ward the vault. Bury it. No flame we command can touch it, and the Gauntlet cannot rule it. It is the one thing in the world that frightens him.")
